\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\kerning2\b\f0\fs24 KEY MODELS:\par
GPT\b0 -\lang16393 GPT (Generative Pre-trained Transformer) is a type of artificial intelligence model designed to understand and generate human-like text. It is built using a deep learning architecture called the Transformer, which helps the model analyze relationships between words and understand context in language.\par
The architecture behind GPT is the Transformer, introduced in 2017, which uses a mechanism called self-attention to understand relationships between words and context.\par
Evolution of GPT Models\par
GPT-1 (2018)\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1 First proof-of-concept GPT model.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Around 117 million parameters.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Demonstrated that pre-training on large text corpora followed by fine-tuning could achieve strong results.\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1 GPT-2 (2019)\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1 1.5 billion parameters.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Significantly improved text generation.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Produced coherent paragraphs and essays.\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1 GPT-3 (2020)\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1 175 billion parameters.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Enabled few-shot and zero-shot learning.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Became widely used for chatbots, coding, content generation, and automation.\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1 GPT-3.5 (2022)\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1 Optimized for conversational AI.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Powered the early versions of ChatGPT.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Faster and more practical for interactive use.\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1 GPT-4 (2023)\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1 Stronger reasoning capabilities.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Better at complex problem solving and coding.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Reduced hallucinations compared to previous versions.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Supports multimodal inputs in certain versions.\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1 GPT-4o (2024)\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1 The "o" stands for omni.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Can process text, images, and audio.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Faster and more cost-efficient than GPT-4 for many tasks.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Designed for real-time interactions.\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1 GPT-5 (Current Generation)\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1 Further improvements in reasoning, instruction following, accuracy, and tool usage.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Better at handling complex workflows, coding tasks, document analysis, and long conversations.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Used in experiences such as M365 Copilot.\par

