\b DALL\'b7E\par
DALL\'b7E\b0  is a family of \b text-to-image generative AI models\b0  developed by \b OpenAI\b0 . While GPT is designed to generate and understand text, DALL\'b7E is designed to \b generate images from natural language descriptions (prompts)\b0 .\par
The name \b DALL\'b7E\b0  combines:\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b Salvador Dal\'ed\b0 , the famous surrealist artist.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}\b WALL-E\b0 , Pixar's robot character.\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1 This reflects the model's goal of combining creativity with artificial intelligence.\par
\b Evolution of DALL\'b7E Models\par
DALL\'b7E (2021)\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b0 First version of the model.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Introduced text-to-image generation at a large scale.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Could create imaginative and surreal images from textual descriptions.\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b DALL\'b7E 2 (2022)\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b0 Major improvement in image quality and realism.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Higher resolution outputs.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Added image editing and image variation capabilities.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Better understanding of complex prompts.\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b DALL\'b7E 3 (2023)\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b0 Significant advancement in prompt understanding.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Much better at generating images that accurately match detailed instructions.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Improved rendering of text within images.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Integrated with conversational AI systems, allowing users to refine images through natural language.\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\par
