\b0 Word1 \f2\u8594?\f1\lang16393  Word2 \f2\u8594?\f1\lang16393  Word3 \f2\u8594?\f1\lang16393  Word4\par
\b Transformer\par
\b0 Word1\par
Word2\par
Word3\par
Word4\par
\~ \f2\u8595?\f1\lang16393\par
Processed Together\par
This allows:\par

